-    *   Calculate length: $L = \text{length}(g2)$ [S1, unofficial].
-    *   If $L > 0.0$:
-        *   Normalize: $g2_{norm} = \text{normalize}(g2)$ [S1, unofficial].
-        *   Transform to eye space: $g2 = \text{transposeTextureToEye} \times g2_{norm}$ [S1, unofficial].
-    *   Else:
-        *   Set $g2 = (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)$ [S1, unofficial].
